      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One backend, two shells",
      "items": [
        "Feature screens live in packages/app and render on web via react-native-web",
        "apps/mobile is the same screens behind Expo Router; CI always bundles iOS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Domain writes stay in modules",
      "items": [
        "identity, tenancy, coaching, nutrition, notifications export public barrels",
        "apps/api is a composition root: middleware, JWT, route registration. Media lands on R2 / MinIO."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Nutrition numbers never leave Layer 1–2",
      "items": [
        "Layer-3 names meals and writes prep notes, then fails closed to templates",
